{
  "name": "Check QR codes and barcodes in label images against an expected value",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check QR codes and barcodes before you publish them\n\nThis workflow reads every label image in a folder, decodes its QR codes and barcodes on this n8n instance, and compares what it read with the value you expect.\n\nEach image ends in one of four results: **Expected value found**, **Wrong value**, **No code found** or **Unreadable image**.\n\n### Requirements\n- Self-hosted n8n with the community node `@qrcode-ai-com/n8n-nodes-qrcode-barcode-scanner` 0.1.0 (Settings, Community Nodes, Install). n8n Cloud cannot install it.\n- The images in a folder this n8n may read.\n\nThe scan runs locally with the open-source QR Code & Barcode Scanner engine: no API key, no upload, and decoded links are never opened.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a8aa6315-fc9d-57fe-861a-a0d866f03f63",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup\n1. Open **Settings** and set `expectedText` to the value your labels must carry, and `imageFiles` to the image files to check, as a path or a pattern such as `/home/node/.n8n-files/labels/*.png`.\n2. n8n reads files only from the folders it allows. The default is `~/.n8n-files`; `N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO` changes it.\n3. Click **Execute workflow**.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "7a078ddc-ed0b-5a76-a115-761b0adfe214",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Scan\nThe scanner reads the binary field `data` of each file. Profile **Frame** decodes without scoring. Choose **Full** to also score QR scannability.\n\nA corrupt image goes to the error output instead of stopping the run.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "06083fae-e039-58b5-ac8c-c4488cdf491c",
      "name": "Scan section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Results\nEach branch writes one item per image with its `status`: the file name and what was read, or, for an unreadable image, the error and its code. Connect a spreadsheet, a chat message or a ticket after them.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "aebb2c0e-3ea1-5cc0-a3f2-7f645fd5b54d",
      "name": "Results section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "5dbed8f6-2db1-5491-ab66-11f494a65e84",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "8425ac91-d587-5c95-abe0-120effcf877e",
              "name": "expectedText",
              "value": "STOCK-4827",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "59f75750-6021-5766-a1a3-0cb36727f697",
              "name": "imageFiles",
              "value": "/home/node/.n8n-files/labels/*.png",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1b258644-6fe5-53a1-8ccc-cb5ef4c82f74",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "fileSelector": "={{ $json.imageFiles }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20c8ffbe-bac4-5f34-bda1-5c893302e1d3",
      "name": "Read label images",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "profile": "frame",
        "output": "image",
        "options": {
          "includeReport": false
        }
      },
      "id": "8ae3e610-31c6-5e1b-a008-def38afe2433",
      "name": "Scan QR codes and barcodes",
      "type": "@qrcode-ai-com/n8n-nodes-qrcode-barcode-scanner.qrcodeBarcodeScanner",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "2a6ff816-c3da-50cb-bcc2-e06d9267fed5",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.count }}",
                    "rightValue": 0,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "No code found"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "9b0e5689-b2de-5615-9db5-c51879848ebe",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.texts }}",
                    "rightValue": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.expectedText }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "operation": "contains",
                      "rightType": "any"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Expected value found"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "Wrong value"
        }
      },
      "id": "d6b9b68e-c50c-5eaf-b623-3390ae2bfe5c",
      "name": "Compare with the expected value",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
